### GET request to example server
GET http://localhost:8080/api/results?year=2021

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/season-champions?startYear=2024&endYear=2025

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/seasons

### List race winner for season
GET http://localhost:8080/api/f1/race-winners/2019

### List all seasons
GET http://localhost:8080/api/f1/seasons

### Sync race results
POST http://localhost:8080/api/internal/sync-latest-race-results

### Sync season results
POST http://localhost:8080/api/internal/sync-season-champions
